# Local development:
# - Copy client/.env.example to client/.env.local for a direct backend connection,
#   or leave VITE_API_URL unset to use the Vite development proxy.
# - Copy server/.env.example to server/.env and add your Gemini API key.
#
# Production:
# - Vercel: set VITE_API_URL to the public Render backend URL.
# - Render: set CLIENT_URL to the Vercel site origin and GEMINI_API_KEY in the
#   Render dashboard. Never put GEMINI_API_KEY in a VITE_* variable.
